Local changes: the MIME mapping covers the audio formats Media3 can route and FFmpeg's
native LGPL decoders handle (DTS/DTS Express/DTS-HD, TrueHD, AC-3, E-AC-3, AAC, MP1/MP2/MP3,
Vorbis, Opus, FLAC, ALAC, AMR-NB/WB, G.711 mu-law/A-law, and MS-GSM). Video is never
claimed, and missing codec-private data no longer throws. The JNI wrapper is dynamically linked to the existing
FFmpeg 9.0-series shared libraries packaged in app/libs/mpvlib.aar. The MPVFlow arm64
build pins FFmpeg n9.0.2. That runtime is built with --disable-gpl --disable-nonfree
--enable-version3 and carries LGPL-3.0-or-later;
no GPL or nonfree decoder is added by this module.
